  "chain": "vendor conversion-factor error / defective calibration procedure [cause D] -> ARMIRE5400B incorrect conversion factor + keep-alive source not accounted -> ARMIRE5400B out of factor-2 tolerance -> declared inoperable / TS non-compliance since 2019 (dual-channel inoperability with ARMIRE5400A); separately -> ARMIRE5500A missing reference-value recording steps -> out of +/-15% tolerance -> declared inoperable since 2000 [alternate dose-assessment methods available]",
  "golden_questions": [
